1
00:00:01,500 --> 00:00:05,500
sent 1.5s: The colossal sandstorm crashes over the caravan and races at the rider; the dust wall swallows the camels one by one.

2
00:00:05,500 --> 00:00:10,000
sent 5.5s: The rider gallops into the sandstorm: swirling red dust fills the entire frame, the sun is gone, only his white cloak shows in the orange haze.

3
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:14,000
sent 10.0s: Deep inside the storm the dust glows; tall shining shapes loom faintly through it ahead of the rider.

4
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:19,000
sent 14.0s: The sandstorm thins and blows past behind the rider. The dust clears to reveal the far future: gleaming silver towers, glass domes over a green oasis city, fields of solar mirrors, a train gliding on tall pylons across the plain.

5
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:25,000
sent 19.0s: Clear bright sky now. The rider on his grey horse gallops toward an Afrofuturist Ethiopian city: white and copper towers carved like rock-hewn churches, banners woven with tibeb patterns, green terraces with water channels.

6
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:35,635
sent 25.0s: Black Ethiopian people in white cotton and silver cloth wave from the terraces as the rider arrives; drones carry water over the green fields.
